# The tests of sem-ch02-map-literal-doubled.
emit Ui.*
use App.*

test it_builds, @page:
    build
        => expect Ui.Label(text="3 5 2 0 1 2")
# Derived by hand from Language ch. 7 (a map's literal, `scores[name]` a `?Nat`) and Jimmy's ruling of 12 November (the literal doubled): `Scores 3` holds ada 3 and bo 5, the empty map has no key, `Picked 4` one, and the inner map of `Nested 1` two.
